     A            PPMOD     R               REFFLD(MOD)
     A            PPSPCD    R               REFFLD(SPEC)
     A            PPSTS     R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('A/I' 'STATUS')
     A***                                     Valid Values:
     A***                                        A = Active
     A***                                        I = Inactive
     A            PPRSTR    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('Y/N' 'RESTRICTED')
     A***                                     Valid Values:
     A***                                        Y = Restricted
     A***                                        N = Unrestricted
     A            PPPCP     R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('PRIMARY' 'CARE PHYS')
     A***         For CLT087: POR (Physician of Record)
     A***                                     Valid Values:
     A***                                        Y = Yes, is Primary Care Phys
     A***                                        N = No, is NOT Primary Care Phy
     A            PPSTAT    R               REFFLD(STAT)
     A                                      COLHDG('RCD' 'STS')
     A            PPUSER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('MAINT' 'USER')
     A            PPPGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('MAINT' 'PGM')
     A            PPTIME    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('MAINT' 'TIME')
     A            PPDT      R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('MAINT' 'DATE')
